# Harness manager state (machine-local). Restore with `harness heal` / `harness mcp sync`.
# Declarative config (.mcp.json, subagent .md files) stays tracked; only derived state is ignored.
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
.claude/skills
agent/
skills-lock.json
.codebase-memory/

# Harness adapter dirs: symlinks into .agents/, recreated by `harness heal` on any machine
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.dsh/
.opencode/

# Harness-generated MCP projection for pi-like harnesses (regenerate with `harness mcp sync`)
.pi/

# Project-private skills are SOURCE, not derived: when you add one with `harness skill create <name>`,
# un-ignore it here so it ships with the repo, e.g.  !.agents/skills/my-skill/

!docs/fullplan.md
docs/dev-history/editor_port_full_plan.md
